---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
---

<section class="border-b border-border-base">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <p
      class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border-base bg-bg-raised px-3 py-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-text-secondary"
    >
      <Icon name="lucide:terminal" class="size-3.5 text-accent" />
      Workshop · Aprende a usar Claude Code
    </p>

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary sm:text-6xl">
      Claude Code, en serio.
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-text-secondary sm:text-xl">
      Una landing didáctica para entender las piezas que hacen útil a Claude Code en el día a día:
      <span class="text-accent">skills</span>,
      <span class="text-accent">hooks</span>,
      <span class="text-accent">slash commands</span> y
      <span class="text-accent">MCP</span>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a
        href="/docs/skills"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-accent px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-bg-base hover:bg-accent-hover transition"
      >
        Empezar por las skills
        <Icon name="lucide:arrow-right" class="size-4" />
      </a>
      <a
        href="#recursos"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border-base px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-text-primary hover:border-border-strong hover:bg-bg-raised transition"
      >
        Ver recursos
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
